# prettier already skips everything in .gitignore, so this file only holds what is
# tracked but must NOT be formatted. That is also why the four generated sources
# need no entry here: src/util/wasm-binary.ts, src/util/pg-wasm-shim.js,
# src/util/version.ts and src/yivi/yivi-css-text.ts are in .gitignore, written by
# the generate-* scripts on every prebuild.
#
# Both entries below are tracked AND machine-written, so formatting them puts
# prettier in a loop with their writer:
#
#   etc/pg-js.api.md is written by scripts/api-report.mjs and gated by
#   `postbuild: node scripts/api-report.mjs --check`. Format it and the build goes
#   red, because the report is rendered from the built types and the writer owns
#   its layout.
#
#   tests/fixtures/envelopes/*.json are written by
#   scripts/generate-envelope-fixtures.mjs and gated by `envelope:check`, which
#   holds the corpus append-only — a reformat there reads as rewriting bytes a
#   sender actually emitted.
#
# CHANGELOG.md is deliberately NOT here: `changeset version` formats each
# changelog through prettier using the owning package's config, so ignoring it
# would make `pnpm lint` skip a file another writer still formats.
etc/pg-js.api.md
tests/fixtures/envelopes/*.json
